job_description:
A large IT-company is looking for a Front-end developer for building HTML web-pages.

Requirements:

• Expertise in building cross-browser-compatible HTML web-pages using modern techniques and technologies;

• CSS, LESS, SCSS;

• Experience with graphics packages such as Adobe PhotoShop, Adobe FireWorks, etc.

• Experience with Block Layout using CSS sprites;

• Proficiency with libraries such as Bootstrap, Material Design;

• Understanding of W3C standards.

Preferred Qualifications:

• Ability to write a clean code (formatting, comments, standards);

• Knowledge of zeplin.io online service;

• Ability to work with already-existing codes;

• Knowledge of web application optimization techniques.

We offer:

• Competitive compensation based on qualifications and experience;

• Office in the city center with convenient parking;

• Medical insurance;

• Friendly, smart, passionate and hard-working coworkers;

• Opportunities for professional growth and advancement;

• Training.

Research & Design

The team is dedicated to the development and support of web services and websites of company products.

We are Electronic Team, Inc.

Electronic Team is a technology development company that specializes in producing high-quality software applications working across all major platforms. We plan, analyze, design, implement, test, maintain and support our products in order to meet the highest expectations and demands of our customers.
